    "body": "\"git\" is not informed that all Vim files in vim_na_files.txt are N/A to Neovim.\nGit requires \"exclude\" pathspec (:^) to use vim_na_files.txt.\n\npathspec supports globs and character ranges.\nMigrate regexs from vim_na_regexp.txt to optimize grep.\n\nhttps://git-scm.com/docs/gitglossary#Documentation/gitglossary.txt-pathspec\n\n-----\n\nDraft because I want to migrate/add more patterns/globs/files.\n\nGoal is to use this new file to speed up all other operations that deal with Vim repo (.vim-src/) but that requires these `scripts/vim_na_` files to be \"complete\" to not miss actually relevant patches.",
    "closed_at": null,
